<p>You briefly open a tunnel through spacetime, teleporting to a void rift in range 10. This destroys the rift, granting you a shield for 4 turns absorbing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">248, 334, 401, 458, 508</acronym> damage.</p><p>The damage absorbed will scale with your Spellpower</p>